    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client requirements, we can propose a solution that leverages we expertise in large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned to provide accurate and relevant answers to agents' queries.  we can utilize we RAG capabilities, including dense vector semantic retrieval and BM25 sparse retrieval strategies, to facilitate access to information and improve answer quality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we chunking strategies, such as recursive text splitter and semantic chunking, can help contextualize answers." ;
