        ex:hasText "To recall applicable rules and suggest actions or verifications, we can integrate we LLMs with a knowledge graph that contains relevant regulatory information and internal procedures. we experience with open-source contributions, including the French NER model, can be leveraged to improve the accuracy of entity recognition and extraction in this context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of integration with our existing technical stack, we can utilize we expertise in vector stores, such as Qdrant and Weaviate, to store and manage the knowledge graph and other relevant data. we proficiency in fine-tuning methods, including LoRA and QLoRA, can be applied to adapt we LLMs to the client's specific domain and tone." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explainability and transparency, we can implement we XAI methods, such as source citation and chain-of-thought display, to provide insights into the decision-making process of we AI solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we confidence scoring and low-confidence threshold mechanisms can be used to escalate uncertain or unclear queries to human supervisors for review." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

